1
00:00:38,413 --> 00:00:40,666
THE REMARRIED EMPRESS

2
00:00:44,044 --> 00:00:45,546
I forbid this.

3
00:00:48,840 --> 00:00:50,633
I cannot let this happen.

4
00:00:57,557 --> 00:00:58,684
Good lord…

5
00:01:02,646 --> 00:01:04,230
What is this, Empress?

6
00:01:04,231 --> 00:01:05,440
It is outrageous.

7
00:01:06,817 --> 00:01:07,901
Well?

8
00:01:12,489 --> 00:01:13,865
I do not understand.

9
00:01:14,616 --> 00:01:16,451
Your Majesty has ended my reign.

10
00:01:18,412 --> 00:01:20,372
May I remind you we are not married.

11
00:01:21,123 --> 00:01:23,208
You made the decision
to terminate our marriage.

12
00:01:24,710 --> 00:01:26,461
I am free to decide.

13
00:01:28,380 --> 00:01:30,716
No explanation will be owed
to my ex-husband.

14
00:01:32,426 --> 00:01:34,136
"Ex-husband"?

15
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,348
Ex-husband…

16
00:01:39,766 --> 00:01:41,977
Even if I am your ex-husband,

17
00:01:43,812 --> 00:01:49,276
I am still… the ruler of this nation
where you reside…

18
00:01:51,486 --> 00:01:53,322
and where you belong.

19
00:01:55,532 --> 00:01:57,200
I will never allow this.

20
00:01:59,369 --> 00:02:01,078
You will not remarry.

21
00:02:05,459 --> 00:02:07,002
Emperor Sovieshu…

22
00:02:09,087 --> 00:02:12,924
that is the law's decision to make.

23
00:03:27,290 --> 00:03:29,041
She is a frightening woman.

24
00:03:29,042 --> 00:03:32,294
Switching to another king
the moment she gets divorced.

25
00:03:32,295 --> 00:03:33,922
She could have waited a while.

26
00:03:35,006 --> 00:03:37,759
Is she unable to live without power
for a single day?

27
00:03:45,851 --> 00:03:47,018
Majesty?

28
00:03:50,897 --> 00:03:52,149
Forgive me…

29
00:03:54,860 --> 00:03:56,611
I need to be alone for a while.

30
00:04:02,784 --> 00:04:04,828
I am outraged too, Your Majesty.

31
00:04:06,037 --> 00:04:07,788
What must all the people think,

32
00:04:07,789 --> 00:04:09,916
celebrating her divorce
by trying to marry another.

33
00:04:22,262 --> 00:04:24,431
And the deposed empress, as she now is,

34
00:04:25,807 --> 00:04:27,851
was Heinrey's pen pal, I believe.

35
00:04:33,732 --> 00:04:35,232
What do you mean?

36
00:04:35,233 --> 00:04:37,443
I am saying that
they were secretly in love.

37
00:04:37,444 --> 00:04:39,571
Their love letters were exchanged by bird.

38
00:04:40,405 --> 00:04:43,074
The two of them
had been having a romance all along.

39
00:04:48,038 --> 00:04:50,916
That is why Rashta pretended
to be his secret pen pal.

40
00:04:52,709 --> 00:04:54,753
I believed I could shield the Empress.

41
00:04:56,213 --> 00:04:59,132
But to think
she would betray you so easily…

42
00:05:01,802 --> 00:05:03,428
I am deeply upset.

43
00:05:05,180 --> 00:05:08,600
Had I known all this would happen,
I would have made you aware far sooner.

44
00:05:11,478 --> 00:05:14,689
Rashta has made
a very bad judgment.

45
00:05:39,464 --> 00:05:40,841
McKenna?

46
00:05:42,801 --> 00:05:46,053
Hey! Is that a Leopard Cat I see?

47
00:05:47,931 --> 00:05:49,932
- He remembers me!
- You, Leopard Cat!

48
00:05:49,933 --> 00:05:51,308
General, I'm here!

49
00:05:51,309 --> 00:05:52,894
General Kosair!

50
00:05:57,899 --> 00:05:59,358
General Kosair!

51
00:05:59,359 --> 00:06:00,818
Why are you here?

52
00:06:00,819 --> 00:06:03,362
- I never thought I'd see you here.
- Oh, no!

53
00:06:03,363 --> 00:06:04,614
Your poor face.

54
00:06:05,657 --> 00:06:08,534
We heard the news that you were banished
and had to flee the East,

55
00:06:08,535 --> 00:06:10,161
so King Heinrey sent me to fetch you back.

56
00:06:10,745 --> 00:06:12,121
Ah!

57
00:06:12,122 --> 00:06:14,081
He said to escort you back to his palace.

58
00:06:14,082 --> 00:06:15,250
Heinrey did?

59
00:06:15,876 --> 00:06:17,167
Yes.

60
00:06:17,168 --> 00:06:18,961
We have news regarding Sir Kosair.

61
00:06:18,962 --> 00:06:21,964
He has been forcibly expelled
from the Eastern Empire.

62
00:06:21,965 --> 00:06:23,173
Expelled?

63
00:06:23,174 --> 00:06:26,051
He was stripped of his rank
and banished permanently.

64
00:06:26,052 --> 00:06:28,763
He allegedly threatened
the Emperor's unborn child.

65
00:06:30,682 --> 00:06:32,016
Do you know his whereabouts right now?

66
00:06:32,017 --> 00:06:34,269
We have heard he is near
to the Duchy of Oze.

67
00:06:41,985 --> 00:06:44,321
You said "king"?

68
00:06:45,614 --> 00:06:46,906
King Heinrey!

69
00:06:46,907 --> 00:06:47,991
He's the king now?

70
00:06:48,617 --> 00:06:49,618
He is.

71
00:06:54,372 --> 00:06:56,333
I am sorry I could not
tell you before.

72
00:06:57,709 --> 00:06:59,419
I know how worried you were.

73
00:07:00,420 --> 00:07:01,796
I was very afraid,

74
00:07:02,422 --> 00:07:04,382
but I could endure it
knowing you were nearby.

75
00:07:05,925 --> 00:07:07,427
You did the right thing.

76
00:07:08,637 --> 00:07:10,180
I'm excited for you.

77
00:07:12,599 --> 00:07:14,016
So, Your Majesties…

78
00:07:14,017 --> 00:07:16,518
When would you like to set off
for the Western Kingdom?

79
00:07:16,519 --> 00:07:18,146
The divorce is finalized.

80
00:07:18,855 --> 00:07:20,357
I should vacate the palace now.

81
00:07:20,940 --> 00:07:23,192
I will take away all my belongings.

82
00:07:23,193 --> 00:07:25,320
I am sure when the new lady
takes her place,

83
00:07:26,071 --> 00:07:27,739
she will make some big changes here.

84
00:07:28,615 --> 00:07:30,033
The new lady.

85
00:07:31,910 --> 00:07:32,911
I'll help with that.

86
00:07:33,495 --> 00:07:35,538
I will write out a full list
and report to you.

87
00:07:36,373 --> 00:07:38,124
So do please wait a little longer.

88
00:07:53,139 --> 00:07:54,932
Just to think of a new lady at the palace…

89
00:07:54,933 --> 00:07:58,060
I think I may follow Her Majesty
to the Western Kingdom.

90
00:07:58,061 --> 00:08:00,938
How can I stay living here
with that girl on the throne?

91
00:08:00,939 --> 00:08:02,356
She could live here.

92
00:08:02,357 --> 00:08:04,109
Or she could live with His Majesty.

93
00:08:04,859 --> 00:08:06,695
It makes no difference to me.

94
00:08:07,862 --> 00:08:09,822
The Empire without our Empress…

95
00:08:09,823 --> 00:08:11,199
that's the real issue.

96
00:08:14,536 --> 00:08:16,078
She gave us strength.

97
00:08:16,079 --> 00:08:17,955
Without her, the pillar has tumbled down.

98
00:08:17,956 --> 00:08:19,165
Our pillar.

99
00:08:26,965 --> 00:08:28,633
What is this about?

100
00:08:29,467 --> 00:08:31,385
How dare you come
into the Empress' palace?

101
00:08:31,386 --> 00:08:32,803
I'm sorry.

102
00:08:32,804 --> 00:08:34,806
Who do you think
the Empress of the Eastern Empire is?

103
00:08:35,473 --> 00:08:36,474
Let's go.

104
00:08:37,851 --> 00:08:40,144
Oh, oh, oh, wait… Wait a minute.

105
00:08:40,145 --> 00:08:42,146
What are you doing? Stop!

106
00:08:42,147 --> 00:08:43,981
This doesn't concern you.
Now move!

107
00:08:43,982 --> 00:08:46,400
Step aside, step back!

108
00:08:46,401 --> 00:08:49,278
-  Oh, I told you, you can't!
-  You can't do this.

109
00:08:49,279 --> 00:08:51,905
What on earth do you think you're doing?

110
00:08:51,906 --> 00:08:53,282
No, I said you can't!

111
00:08:53,283 --> 00:08:55,034
- This is Her Majesty's palace!
-  Step aside!

112
00:08:55,035 --> 00:08:57,453
- Step aside!
-  Why are you doing this?

113
00:08:57,454 --> 00:08:59,079
Please stop!

114
00:09:10,884 --> 00:09:12,092
We do not have long.

115
00:09:15,764 --> 00:09:17,307
I've got a plan, Navier.

116
00:09:19,809 --> 00:09:21,895
- Search everywhere.
-  Yes, sir!

117
00:09:25,815 --> 00:09:27,650
Stop!

118
00:09:29,360 --> 00:09:31,195
Stop that immediately!

119
00:09:31,196 --> 00:09:34,323
Why are you looking in here?
What are you looking for?

120
00:09:34,324 --> 00:09:35,824
Why are you doing this?

121
00:09:35,825 --> 00:09:37,535
Hey! Leave that alone!

122
00:09:40,288 --> 00:09:41,414
- This way.
-  Yes, sir.

123
00:09:49,297 --> 00:09:52,466
His Majesty has made the commandment
that you must be confined at once.

124
00:09:52,467 --> 00:09:53,634
Really?

125
00:09:58,098 --> 00:10:01,266
I must discuss this with the Emperor now.
Move aside.

126
00:10:01,267 --> 00:10:03,727
You can't do that.
His Majesty won't see just anyone.

127
00:10:03,728 --> 00:10:04,729
What did you say?

128
00:10:06,481 --> 00:10:09,191
How dare you insult my queen-to-be
and imprison her?

129
00:10:09,192 --> 00:10:11,319
If you proceed,
there'll be conflict with the West.

130
00:10:12,070 --> 00:10:13,905
You threaten conflict with us.

131
00:10:17,700 --> 00:10:20,203
You must know your plan
has made that certain.

132
00:10:21,246 --> 00:10:22,538
We have found it.

133
00:10:22,539 --> 00:10:23,832
WOULDN'T YOU SAY OUR MEETING WAS FATE?

134
00:10:26,751 --> 00:10:29,211
You traveled here
with the intention of spying

135
00:10:29,212 --> 00:10:30,838
and undermining this palace.

136
00:10:30,839 --> 00:10:33,591
You tried to abduct
the deposed empress, as well.

137
00:10:34,801 --> 00:10:36,010
Abduct?

138
00:10:36,803 --> 00:10:39,264
Don't tell tales to me, Sovieshu.

139
00:10:40,557 --> 00:10:42,475
You will go to prison at once.

140
00:10:46,187 --> 00:10:47,981
I will see you soon.

141
00:10:48,940 --> 00:10:50,108
So please do not worry.

142
00:10:51,776 --> 00:10:52,819
I'll wait for you.

143
00:10:54,404 --> 00:10:56,781
- Guards, hurry and take him away!
-  Yes, Your Majesty.

144
00:11:01,327 --> 00:11:02,829
I will go with you.

145
00:11:11,379 --> 00:11:13,339
How can you behave so poorly?

146
00:11:15,049 --> 00:11:16,885
Everybody, leave us.

147
00:11:24,517 --> 00:11:27,520
Just divorced, and already engaged.

148
00:11:28,563 --> 00:11:30,522
When did this begin?

149
00:11:30,523 --> 00:11:34,194
Was there something happening
that I knew nothing about?

150
00:11:34,903 --> 00:11:37,614
And the awful thing
is that you chose Heinrey.

151
00:11:39,157 --> 00:11:41,450
Why him, if you had to at all?

152
00:11:41,451 --> 00:11:43,328
What went on between the two of you?

153
00:11:51,169 --> 00:11:53,963
You were swapping letters
with that scoundrel.

154
00:11:54,923 --> 00:11:56,591
Look what you've done.

155
00:11:58,760 --> 00:12:01,846
You've lured Rashta into a trap,
while on the inside,

156
00:12:03,056 --> 00:12:06,433
you fell for a promiscuous foreign prince.

157
00:12:06,434 --> 00:12:08,519
I warned you, didn't I?

158
00:12:09,479 --> 00:12:10,939
That bastard…

159
00:12:12,232 --> 00:12:14,734
I told you that he was
never to be trusted.

160
00:12:16,152 --> 00:12:18,404
The divorce suit was pursued by you.

161
00:12:19,989 --> 00:12:22,699
You wanted to have her
as your wife instead.

162
00:12:22,700 --> 00:12:24,619
That is why you publicly divorced me.

163
00:12:26,412 --> 00:12:29,915
So you want to take revenge, is that it?
Did you want to torment me?

164
00:12:29,916 --> 00:12:31,625
Did you really want to hurt me enough

165
00:12:31,626 --> 00:12:34,671
to choose a flashy,
second-choice heir like that Heinrey?

166
00:12:39,259 --> 00:12:41,678
My choices do not revolve
around your emotions.

167
00:12:42,428 --> 00:12:44,514
Your torment is not my responsibility.

168
00:12:45,682 --> 00:12:49,894
I have better things to do
than waste time trying to upset you.

169
00:12:52,146 --> 00:12:53,855
The decision is made.

170
00:12:53,856 --> 00:12:55,440
I chose to rebuild my life.

171
00:13:00,530 --> 00:13:01,864
You should proceed…

172
00:13:02,448 --> 00:13:04,450
and move forward on your chosen path…

173
00:13:05,451 --> 00:13:07,370
with Rashta at your side.

174
00:13:08,579 --> 00:13:11,165
I never envisioned a path
without you being there with me.

175
00:13:13,418 --> 00:13:15,502
Once Rashta has sat on the throne,

176
00:13:15,503 --> 00:13:18,798
and the officials have secured
the child's legitimacy as the heir,

177
00:13:20,300 --> 00:13:21,925
we would remarry

178
00:13:21,926 --> 00:13:23,094
because I need you.

179
00:13:24,679 --> 00:13:26,055
Is that up to you?

180
00:13:28,266 --> 00:13:30,101
In all of our known history,

181
00:13:30,852 --> 00:13:32,103
perhaps forever,

182
00:13:33,313 --> 00:13:35,940
there has never once been
a remarried empress.

183
00:13:39,777 --> 00:13:41,654
In that case, I shall be the first.

184
00:13:52,915 --> 00:13:54,208
Don't go, Navier.

185
00:13:57,128 --> 00:13:58,837
If you stay, I will let that…

186
00:14:06,012 --> 00:14:07,305
Heinrey…

187
00:14:07,805 --> 00:14:09,390
He can be acquitted.

188
00:14:12,268 --> 00:14:13,936
But even if that is true…

189
00:14:15,354 --> 00:14:16,898
he will not leave anyway.

190
00:14:18,775 --> 00:14:22,612
He will never go to his palace on his own
and leave me here.

191
00:14:26,449 --> 00:14:28,201
Even if I were locked away

192
00:14:29,327 --> 00:14:31,120
and forced to stay with you,

193
00:14:33,206 --> 00:14:34,665
I'm no longer by your side…

194
00:14:35,500 --> 00:14:36,833
in my heart.

195
00:14:49,472 --> 00:14:50,847
Stop that, Sovieshu.

196
00:14:54,143 --> 00:14:55,561
You know it is over.

197
00:15:05,279 --> 00:15:06,947
Commander!

198
00:15:08,991 --> 00:15:10,576
Yes, Your Majesty?

199
00:15:21,629 --> 00:15:24,048
Close all of the palace's windows at once.

200
00:15:27,635 --> 00:15:29,679
Look out for a bird flying…

201
00:15:31,430 --> 00:15:33,933
carrying letters in its beak.

202
00:15:39,147 --> 00:15:41,315
I want all the archers here.

203
00:15:42,984 --> 00:15:46,154
They must all shoot to kill.

204
00:15:54,996 --> 00:15:56,247
Clear…

205
00:15:56,914 --> 00:15:58,708
the entire sky.

206
00:16:06,090 --> 00:16:10,677
WOULDN'T YOU SAY OUR MEETING WAS FATE?

207
00:16:25,526 --> 00:16:28,154
I want to ensure
the Empress never marries again.

208
00:16:30,531 --> 00:16:32,283
Bring me every legal treatise.

209
00:16:35,536 --> 00:16:37,913
Ah, no. The books
are not going to help me.

210
00:16:41,167 --> 00:16:43,044
Just make sure Navier cannot leave.

211
00:16:46,464 --> 00:16:49,508
You will keep her inside
with all the windows locked.

212
00:17:34,220 --> 00:17:35,513
Your Majesty!

213
00:17:36,180 --> 00:17:37,431
General Kosair is--

214
00:17:40,309 --> 00:17:41,394
What's going on?

215
00:17:41,978 --> 00:17:43,645
-  Terrible news, Sir McKenna.
- What?

216
00:17:43,646 --> 00:17:46,856
We have received word that
King Heinrey has been detained in prison.

217
00:17:46,857 --> 00:17:49,150
Has the Eastern Empire dared
to lock up our king?

218
00:17:49,151 --> 00:17:50,569
Sovieshu and Navier…

219
00:17:50,570 --> 00:17:52,737
- They were divorced in a public hearing.
- Divorced?

220
00:17:52,738 --> 00:17:55,533
Apparently, King Heinrey requested
to marry the now-deposed empress.

221
00:17:56,158 --> 00:17:57,410
Ah, also…

222
00:18:00,997 --> 00:18:02,914
HEADING TO THE EASTERN EMPIRE FOR NAVIER

223
00:18:02,915 --> 00:18:05,459
MEET ME AT THE SECRET PASSAGE
ON THE FULL MOON

224
00:18:06,419 --> 00:18:08,712
Let us return there at once.

225
00:18:08,713 --> 00:18:11,590
You must stay here, General.
Where do you think you're going?

226
00:18:11,591 --> 00:18:13,883
You say that because
you don't really know Sovieshu.

227
00:18:13,884 --> 00:18:16,387
If it really has got as bad as this,

228
00:18:17,138 --> 00:18:18,889
he will murder Heinrey for certain.

229
00:18:20,266 --> 00:18:22,225
Would you please make this man
very welcome here?

230
00:18:22,226 --> 00:18:23,393
Yes, sir.

231
00:18:23,394 --> 00:18:24,562
Do not move, just stay here.

232
00:18:25,396 --> 00:18:28,149
I assure you that
I will bring Heinrey back.

233
00:18:29,942 --> 00:18:31,360
You take care out there.

234
00:18:33,362 --> 00:18:34,780
I'll do my best.

235
00:18:59,430 --> 00:19:01,431
There are normally
lots of birds at this time.

236
00:19:01,432 --> 00:19:03,392
They must have all flown away.

237
00:19:04,352 --> 00:19:05,685
Honestly, that Navier…

238
00:19:05,686 --> 00:19:08,772
She should have just vanished discreetly.

239
00:19:08,773 --> 00:19:11,274
What on earth
is His Majesty planning to do?

240
00:19:11,275 --> 00:19:12,817
Is he getting a divorce or not?

241
00:19:12,818 --> 00:19:14,027
Does he actually know?

242
00:19:14,028 --> 00:19:18,199
And now that the Empress wants to leave,
he's developed feelings for her again.

243
00:19:19,325 --> 00:19:21,285
That is not her title.

244
00:19:21,994 --> 00:19:23,412
She's no one.

245
00:19:24,914 --> 00:19:27,041
Even worse, she's the deposed empress.

246
00:19:31,504 --> 00:19:33,421
The "deposed empress." That's right.

247
00:19:33,422 --> 00:19:36,675
And the judge went bang, bang, bang
and declared they were divorced.

248
00:19:36,676 --> 00:19:38,635
Lady Rashta will become the empress.

249
00:19:38,636 --> 00:19:40,721
Surely, His Majesty
will not change his mind.

250
00:19:43,307 --> 00:19:44,308
Wouldn't you agree?

251
00:19:45,101 --> 00:19:47,268
He has no one else to rely on.

252
00:19:47,269 --> 00:19:49,021
His Majesty needs me.

253
00:19:51,107 --> 00:19:52,649
What's important now,

254
00:19:52,650 --> 00:19:54,485
for His Majesty at the very least…

255
00:19:57,488 --> 00:19:58,698
…is this baby.

256
00:20:00,574 --> 00:20:01,659
Although…

257
00:20:02,868 --> 00:20:05,662
once the child is here
and his heir is in place,

258
00:20:05,663 --> 00:20:07,205
I have to leave the throne.

259
00:20:07,206 --> 00:20:09,500
His Majesty's plan
was always to have Navier return.

260
00:20:11,460 --> 00:20:12,461
That's what he said.

261
00:20:16,257 --> 00:20:17,924
How could he even imagine such a thing?

262
00:20:17,925 --> 00:20:20,468
I can understand his reasons now.

263
00:20:20,469 --> 00:20:23,179
He went through it clearly with me.

264
00:20:23,180 --> 00:20:25,307
I would take the throne for only one year.

265
00:20:26,016 --> 00:20:27,768
<i>I will do what I can.</i>

266
00:20:30,104 --> 00:20:32,939
You need only devote yourself
to keeping your body healthy.

267
00:20:32,940 --> 00:20:34,567
And until I say,

268
00:20:35,067 --> 00:20:37,403
keep what we discussed today between us.

269
00:20:47,955 --> 00:20:49,206
It's just for one year.

270
00:20:52,710 --> 00:20:54,127
Only a year?

271
00:20:54,128 --> 00:20:55,796
I think one year is enough

272
00:20:56,464 --> 00:20:58,382
to instill our child as the heir.

273
00:21:01,552 --> 00:21:02,595
Ah…

274
00:21:05,264 --> 00:21:08,601
If you can endure one year
in the position of empress,

275
00:21:09,393 --> 00:21:10,895
I'll take care of you.

276
00:21:11,687 --> 00:21:12,897
I'll protect you.

277
00:21:14,940 --> 00:21:16,859
I'll make sure you're secure for life.

278
00:21:18,986 --> 00:21:21,197
<i>I understand what he meant now…</i>

279
00:21:22,031 --> 00:21:23,114
<i>when he said, "One year."</i>

280
00:21:23,115 --> 00:21:25,576
Crazy bastard.

281
00:21:26,410 --> 00:21:27,703
Do not call him that!

282
00:21:29,079 --> 00:21:30,246
We are married…

283
00:21:30,247 --> 00:21:31,582
and he is the Emperor.

284
00:21:32,792 --> 00:21:34,334
Watch what you say.

285
00:21:34,335 --> 00:21:37,213
There is no one alive who could be
of equal strength to His Majesty.

286
00:21:37,755 --> 00:21:39,881
And without him,
there is no empire either.

287
00:21:39,882 --> 00:21:41,801
Neither you nor I would even be here!

288
00:21:43,052 --> 00:21:44,469
Now we just need to remove

289
00:21:44,470 --> 00:21:46,639
certain tiresome objects
which block our way.

290
00:21:50,267 --> 00:21:52,228
You have spoken a profound truth.

291
00:21:54,814 --> 00:21:56,398
I have struggled all my life…

292
00:21:58,192 --> 00:22:00,027
fighting people for my survival.

293
00:22:01,320 --> 00:22:04,448
I crawled my way up from rock bottom.
You could not even imagine it.

294
00:22:05,074 --> 00:22:06,283
That's why…

295
00:22:07,868 --> 00:22:10,996
I know better than most people
how to survive this world.

296
00:22:11,580 --> 00:22:14,123
It's clear to me
there's one way to survive.

297
00:22:14,124 --> 00:22:15,542
When His Majesty is here,

298
00:22:15,543 --> 00:22:17,545
always ensure he is focused on me.

299
00:22:19,171 --> 00:22:20,506
If we can achieve that…

300
00:22:23,092 --> 00:22:26,011
I will watch my child
carry the royal line.

301
00:22:28,180 --> 00:22:29,640
Watch them rule…

302
00:22:31,934 --> 00:22:33,477
as Empress.

303
00:22:37,898 --> 00:22:41,734
I will lead the way
and travel with you on this path,

304
00:22:41,735 --> 00:22:43,153
Empress.

305
00:22:53,414 --> 00:22:54,582
"Empress."

306
00:23:10,347 --> 00:23:13,224
Have the troops in the north departed yet?

307
00:23:13,225 --> 00:23:16,352
Yes. They are in deployment.

308
00:23:16,353 --> 00:23:17,729
Although there's still a threat from the--

309
00:23:17,730 --> 00:23:20,608
Kosair has crushed
the Springwater Bandits.

310
00:23:22,735 --> 00:23:24,904
The Western Kingdom is a strong one.

311
00:23:25,946 --> 00:23:29,616
Your Majesty, do you truly mean
to fight with the Western Kingdom?

312
00:23:29,617 --> 00:23:31,827
We will see how they react…

313
00:23:32,411 --> 00:23:34,370
to all of this.

314
00:25:02,793 --> 00:25:04,378
Kill King Heinrey.

315
00:25:06,213 --> 00:25:07,464
Oh, my love…

316
00:25:08,298 --> 00:25:12,218
If the Western Kingdom's king dies
in an Eastern Empire prison,

317
00:25:12,219 --> 00:25:13,679
then war is certain to follow.

318
00:25:15,806 --> 00:25:19,059
And if there's an unjust war
due to the Emperor's insanity…

319
00:25:20,853 --> 00:25:24,148
most of the nation
will be forced to take our side.

320
00:25:24,815 --> 00:25:26,191
Good heavens!

321
00:25:27,109 --> 00:25:28,485
You are truly…

322
00:25:42,791 --> 00:25:44,084
Sir McKenna!

323
00:25:45,294 --> 00:25:46,336
The coast is clear.

324
00:25:49,256 --> 00:25:50,715
I came as soon as I got the message.

325
00:25:50,716 --> 00:25:52,008
I'm glad you got here safely.

326
00:25:52,009 --> 00:25:54,510
Sir Kosair said I should make sure
that I could meet you.

327
00:25:54,511 --> 00:25:55,679
Did Sir Kosair make it back?

328
00:25:56,263 --> 00:25:58,139
Mmm-hmm. He is safely in our palace.

329
00:25:58,140 --> 00:26:00,684
He wanted to help us,
but I convinced him to rest.

330
00:26:01,351 --> 00:26:03,437
What we need to do is help the King.

331
00:26:04,146 --> 00:26:05,354
His Majesty is in danger,

332
00:26:05,355 --> 00:26:08,357
but at this rate, an international
conflict is sure to take place.

333
00:26:08,358 --> 00:26:10,319
We need to get them both out post haste.

334
00:26:10,861 --> 00:26:12,278
How do we make that happen?

335
00:26:18,410 --> 00:26:20,996
King Heinrey has already
devised a plan for us to follow.

336
00:26:21,663 --> 00:26:22,664
What's the plan?

337
00:26:23,791 --> 00:26:25,374
A secret passageway.

338
00:26:30,422 --> 00:26:31,757
My Lady!

339
00:26:32,674 --> 00:26:33,758
You're here already.

340
00:26:33,759 --> 00:26:35,594
I asked her to join the two of us.

341
00:26:39,181 --> 00:26:41,100
You might be killed if you do this.

342
00:26:41,892 --> 00:26:43,018
That is a possibility.

343
00:26:44,978 --> 00:26:46,729
Who wants to live forever anyway?

344
00:26:46,730 --> 00:26:49,148
Not me, for one. What about you?

345
00:26:49,149 --> 00:26:50,317
Do you mean it?

346
00:26:52,820 --> 00:26:55,780
If the death is honorable,
then I'd be glad to welcome it.

347
00:26:55,781 --> 00:26:56,782
As would I.

348
00:27:02,121 --> 00:27:03,122
I see your point.

349
00:27:05,624 --> 00:27:06,750
Oh!

350
00:27:09,211 --> 00:27:10,212
And you?

351
00:27:16,009 --> 00:27:18,427
It suits you to be so brave.

352
00:28:06,894 --> 00:28:08,395
Where is he? Find him!

353
00:28:18,614 --> 00:28:20,531
He did say it was around here.

354
00:28:32,294 --> 00:28:34,086
Couldn't you have brought
something more comfortable?

355
00:28:34,087 --> 00:28:35,631
You said lots of buttons looked dashing.

356
00:28:36,506 --> 00:28:37,632
How's that?

357
00:28:37,633 --> 00:28:38,925
Is it pretty?

358
00:28:38,926 --> 00:28:40,093
Far too many buttons.

359
00:28:41,678 --> 00:28:43,763
- Are you ready?
- Since yesterday.

360
00:28:43,764 --> 00:28:44,765
Let's go.

361
00:28:45,265 --> 00:28:46,807
I'm exhausted.

362
00:28:50,020 --> 00:28:51,271
Damn it!

363
00:29:03,241 --> 00:29:04,242
McKenna, quickly!

364
00:29:16,588 --> 00:29:17,713
What is it?

365
00:29:17,714 --> 00:29:19,383
It's King Heinrey, he's disappeared.

366
00:29:24,554 --> 00:29:25,973
<i>I've got a plan, Navier.</i>

367
00:29:26,515 --> 00:29:27,932
I know.

368
00:29:27,933 --> 00:29:29,809
I know your palace has a secret passage.

369
00:29:29,810 --> 00:29:31,102
How did you know that?

370
00:29:31,103 --> 00:29:32,269
Because they all do.

371
00:29:32,270 --> 00:29:33,604
Every palace has one.

372
00:29:33,605 --> 00:29:36,650
I will save you
on the night of the full moon.

373
00:30:03,593 --> 00:30:05,469
All troops are searching for him now.

374
00:30:05,470 --> 00:30:06,804
He is probably still within the palace.

375
00:30:06,805 --> 00:30:07,931
Navier…

376
00:30:08,724 --> 00:30:09,807
Is she still in her quarters?

377
00:30:09,808 --> 00:30:10,809
I will check now.

378
00:30:29,119 --> 00:30:30,162
Heinrey!

379
00:30:38,587 --> 00:30:39,588
Navier!

380
00:30:45,552 --> 00:30:46,720
How do we get through?

381
00:30:52,434 --> 00:30:53,685
Open the door!

382
00:30:56,354 --> 00:30:57,439
Navier?

383
00:30:58,065 --> 00:30:59,107
Navier!

384
00:31:08,116 --> 00:31:09,200
Where is she?

385
00:31:09,201 --> 00:31:10,534
She was…

386
00:31:10,535 --> 00:31:11,536
She was here just before.

387
00:31:26,760 --> 00:31:27,927
We should hurry.

388
00:31:42,776 --> 00:31:43,819
Let's go.

389
00:32:13,598 --> 00:32:15,058
Search all the exits.

390
00:32:18,436 --> 00:32:19,855
If you find Heinrey,

391
00:32:21,523 --> 00:32:22,732
you shoot to kill.

392
00:32:23,233 --> 00:32:24,234
Yes.

393
00:32:36,788 --> 00:32:39,540
Heinrey clearly has conspirators,
so seal off the palace.

394
00:32:39,541 --> 00:32:41,459
Then you will fetch
my armor and sword for me.

395
00:32:42,043 --> 00:32:43,253
I will catch them myself.

396
00:32:47,507 --> 00:32:48,592
We made it.

397
00:32:55,140 --> 00:32:56,266
Are you all right?

398
00:32:58,977 --> 00:33:00,312
Now no one can force us apart.

399
00:33:00,979 --> 00:33:02,479
Mmm.

400
00:33:02,480 --> 00:33:06,026
Sorry, but go a little bit farther
and then be together forever, all right?

401
00:33:06,818 --> 00:33:07,819
Let's go.

402
00:33:10,322 --> 00:33:11,739
Your Majesty,

403
00:33:11,740 --> 00:33:13,949
leave the pursuit of the Empress
to the commanders.

404
00:33:13,950 --> 00:33:15,452
Majesty, please.

405
00:33:16,703 --> 00:33:18,246
Your Majesty! Please!

406
00:33:28,882 --> 00:33:30,342
Your Majesty!

407
00:33:30,842 --> 00:33:31,926
Your Majesty!

408
00:33:31,927 --> 00:33:33,803
-  Your Majesty!
-  Your Majesty!

409
00:33:35,639 --> 00:33:37,098
You must have suffered so much.

410
00:33:38,600 --> 00:33:39,850
There is no time
for this, My Lady.

411
00:33:39,851 --> 00:33:41,101
The guards are searching everywhere.

412
00:33:43,897 --> 00:33:45,315
Once you have made it,

413
00:33:45,815 --> 00:33:47,067
send us news immediately.

414
00:33:48,318 --> 00:33:49,527
I shall.

415
00:33:50,528 --> 00:33:51,655
Thank you all, truly.

416
00:33:53,365 --> 00:33:54,366
We should hurry.

417
00:33:55,617 --> 00:33:56,618
Let's go.

418
00:34:01,289 --> 00:34:02,624
Your Majesty!

419
00:34:03,917 --> 00:34:05,877
It has been a true honor.

420
00:34:06,461 --> 00:34:08,337
I shall really miss you.

421
00:34:08,338 --> 00:34:09,839
Please, travel safely.

422
00:34:10,757 --> 00:34:12,383
Thank you.

423
00:34:12,384 --> 00:34:13,467
Let us go.

424
00:34:14,719 --> 00:34:17,889
I shall ride in the opposite direction
to draw the guards away.

425
00:34:23,144 --> 00:34:24,187
Ha!

426
00:34:40,787 --> 00:34:42,913
They say His Majesty is preparing

427
00:34:42,914 --> 00:34:44,957
to pursue the deposed empress himself.

428
00:34:44,958 --> 00:34:47,460
How could they have
let Heinrey leave alive?

429
00:34:48,169 --> 00:34:49,421
I expect…

430
00:34:50,005 --> 00:34:51,715
there will be no issues for us…

431
00:34:53,967 --> 00:34:55,844
from last night?

432
00:34:56,428 --> 00:34:57,470
Do not worry.

433
00:34:58,179 --> 00:35:00,765
I'll make sure you do not feel the impact.

434
00:35:17,032 --> 00:35:19,700
She could get rid of us
when she is the empress.

435
00:35:19,701 --> 00:35:21,202
Don't you think, Mother?

436
00:35:22,120 --> 00:35:23,496
No need for concern.

437
00:35:44,184 --> 00:35:47,520
That girl Rashta can never defeat me.

438
00:37:02,137 --> 00:37:03,805
Your Majesty!

439
00:37:05,724 --> 00:37:08,727
Rashta Ishka Botulin.

440
00:37:09,519 --> 00:37:10,979
The Empress.

441
00:37:23,283 --> 00:37:24,701
Hear my first order.

442
00:37:25,618 --> 00:37:27,370
All traces of her shall be destroyed.

443
00:37:28,538 --> 00:37:30,081
Erase Navier.

444
00:37:30,707 --> 00:37:31,833
Don't miss a thing.

445
00:37:48,975 --> 00:37:50,310
Your Majesty, I…

446
00:37:51,019 --> 00:37:54,062
I gave you the order
to bring her here before the sunrise,

447
00:37:54,063 --> 00:37:56,148
yet the sun is already high,

448
00:37:56,149 --> 00:37:58,276
and all our guards have let her slip away.

449
00:37:59,402 --> 00:38:01,488
So make sense of that,
if you can.

450
00:38:02,071 --> 00:38:03,447
Even so,

451
00:38:03,448 --> 00:38:05,908
you must put your trust
in the pursuit party.

452
00:38:05,909 --> 00:38:07,494
They were unable to find her.

453
00:38:10,288 --> 00:38:11,371
Listen.

454
00:38:11,372 --> 00:38:12,916
Won't you let me try to get her back?

455
00:38:13,708 --> 00:38:16,251
If you are seen with your helmet
and all your armor,

456
00:38:16,252 --> 00:38:19,506
people will get scared
and think a war has broken out.

457
00:38:20,590 --> 00:38:21,800
Your Majesty…

458
00:38:23,176 --> 00:38:24,177
please.

459
00:38:29,390 --> 00:38:30,600
Listen, Lante.

460
00:38:31,851 --> 00:38:32,852
Yes?

461
00:38:34,187 --> 00:38:37,065
Do you know the worst thing
that anyone can experience?

462
00:38:39,567 --> 00:38:42,278
It is losing the person
you want by your side.

463
00:38:44,280 --> 00:38:46,616
That is the greatest agony of all.

464
00:38:53,206 --> 00:38:54,332
I swear…

465
00:38:55,375 --> 00:38:56,584
I will get her back.

466
00:38:58,419 --> 00:39:02,924
I believe… she will stand
at your side once again.

467
00:39:33,872 --> 00:39:35,664
They found traces
of the fugitives,

468
00:39:35,665 --> 00:39:36,790
but their tracks all split off,

469
00:39:36,791 --> 00:39:38,709
so the search party divided up.

470
00:39:38,710 --> 00:39:40,168
And the border guards? What about them?

471
00:39:40,169 --> 00:39:42,462
We have concentrated our forces
at the Blood Ridge

472
00:39:42,463 --> 00:39:44,506
leading to the Western Kingdom.

473
00:39:44,507 --> 00:39:45,550
Very good.

474
00:39:58,605 --> 00:40:00,523
Whoa, whoa, whoa. Whoa.

475
00:40:16,789 --> 00:40:18,665
Over there. Go!

476
00:40:32,472 --> 00:40:33,931
"Over there!"

477
00:40:33,932 --> 00:40:35,641
While we're here.

478
00:40:38,937 --> 00:40:39,938
Uh…

479
00:40:42,023 --> 00:40:43,566
I knew he'd be no fun.

480
00:41:53,094 --> 00:41:55,512
If we go that way a few miles further,

481
00:41:55,513 --> 00:41:57,015
we will see the Western Kingdom.

482
00:42:22,832 --> 00:42:25,083
When sufficient days have gone by,

483
00:42:25,084 --> 00:42:27,253
the Emperor will see all of this as fate.

484
00:42:33,384 --> 00:42:35,303
I would like to go for a walk alone.

485
00:42:37,305 --> 00:42:38,306
Of course.

486
00:43:15,384 --> 00:43:16,844
<i>My homeland.</i>

487
00:43:20,765 --> 00:43:22,016
<i>My love.</i>

488
00:43:27,855 --> 00:43:29,398
<i>You were once…</i>

489
00:43:34,821 --> 00:43:36,072
<i>my everything.</i>

490
00:44:15,278 --> 00:44:16,404
Navier…

491
00:44:19,657 --> 00:44:21,784
I swear that I will stop at nothing.

492
00:44:24,787 --> 00:44:27,415
Everything you love
will be turned to ruins.

493
00:44:29,625 --> 00:44:30,668
Everything.

494
00:45:56,379 --> 00:45:59,924
The only one…
worthy to be called the Empress…

495
00:46:01,676 --> 00:46:03,094
Empress Navier.

496
00:46:09,600 --> 00:46:12,018
We declare our loyalty.

497
00:46:12,019 --> 00:46:14,230
We declare our loyalty.

498
00:47:18,169 --> 00:47:19,670
This is your kingdom now…

499
00:47:21,213 --> 00:47:22,298
my queen.

500
00:48:32,451 --> 00:48:35,246
<i>I will never
be able to return to that place.</i>

501
00:48:36,288 --> 00:48:38,707
<i>That place which was once my love…</i>

502
00:48:39,834 --> 00:48:41,252
<i>my everything.</i>

503
00:48:43,003 --> 00:48:44,046
Your Majesty.

504
00:48:45,589 --> 00:48:46,590
<i>However…</i>

505
00:48:47,716 --> 00:48:50,386
<i>so long as the sun continues to rise,</i>

506
00:48:51,220 --> 00:48:56,016
<i>my heart will remain unchanged forever.</i>

507
00:49:11,615 --> 00:49:12,658
And now…

508
00:49:13,993 --> 00:49:15,327
let us begin.

509
00:49:21,959 --> 00:49:28,090
THE REMARRIED EMPRESS

510
00:49:36,265 --> 00:49:37,266
Hello?

511
00:49:40,186 --> 00:49:41,353
Your Majesty?

512
00:49:49,111 --> 00:49:50,237
Your Majesty!

513
00:49:53,407 --> 00:49:54,574
You startled me!

514
00:49:54,575 --> 00:49:55,826
What on earth are you playing at?

515
00:49:56,410 --> 00:49:57,620
McKenna.

516
00:49:58,913 --> 00:49:59,996
Yes?

517
00:49:59,997 --> 00:50:02,415
What if I do not rule the kingdom well?

518
00:50:02,416 --> 00:50:03,541
Shh!

519
00:50:03,542 --> 00:50:05,376
What if somebody hears you?

520
00:50:05,377 --> 00:50:07,171
Don't say that
around the Council of Elders.

521
00:50:08,964 --> 00:50:10,215
It's just…

522
00:50:10,216 --> 00:50:11,467
I'm nothing like the late king.

523
00:50:19,683 --> 00:50:23,020
So why did you call for equality
in the first speech you gave?

524
00:50:26,941 --> 00:50:27,942
It's good that you did.

525
00:50:28,817 --> 00:50:30,277
Every word you spoke was the truth.

526
00:50:30,861 --> 00:50:31,904
You did well.

527
00:50:32,404 --> 00:50:33,405
And you will again.

528
00:50:34,949 --> 00:50:36,659
So try not to worry about it.

529
00:50:38,035 --> 00:50:41,120
Besides, with Navier at your side,
you'll be utterly unstoppable.

530
00:50:41,121 --> 00:50:42,373
Don't you think?

531
00:50:45,709 --> 00:50:49,088
I suppose you have told Empress Navier
about our big secret now.

532
00:50:49,880 --> 00:50:51,882
You don't mean me? I'm an open book.

533
00:50:52,341 --> 00:50:53,758
You know…

534
00:50:53,759 --> 00:50:54,885
that we are…

535
00:50:55,678 --> 00:50:56,887
different to all others.

536
00:50:57,763 --> 00:50:59,180
Uh…

537
00:50:59,181 --> 00:51:01,683
Did you tell her Queen is really you?

538
00:51:01,684 --> 00:51:02,977
You did tell her, right?

539
00:51:03,769 --> 00:51:05,478
No.  There was no time, so I--

540
00:51:09,692 --> 00:51:11,276
You mean she doesn't know?

541
00:51:11,277 --> 00:51:13,403
Oh, come on, I didn't have a chance.

542
00:51:13,404 --> 00:51:16,155
If you hide something this secret
and it comes out,

543
00:51:16,156 --> 00:51:17,532
there could be hell to pay.

544
00:51:17,533 --> 00:51:19,576
Maybe she'll even break off the marriage.

545
00:51:19,577 --> 00:51:22,121
What are you going to do? You maniac!

546
00:51:24,582 --> 00:51:26,457
I should come clean to her now,
shouldn't I?

547
00:51:26,458 --> 00:51:28,543
Yes! If you confess on your knees,
or do a handstand.

548
00:51:28,544 --> 00:51:30,087
Go! Go to her now!

549
00:51:31,088 --> 00:51:32,590
- Where is she?
- The garden.

550
00:51:33,507 --> 00:51:34,592
Right.

551
00:51:41,557 --> 00:51:42,725
See you soon.

552
00:51:54,320 --> 00:51:55,945
What about your clothes?

553
00:51:55,946 --> 00:51:57,781
Are you going to kneel to her naked?
